  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「まったくもう、とんだガセネタを掴まされましたの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「かいりの大好きな新進気鋭の地元アイドル……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「メリメロことmerry-melodyが、お祭りの余興として飛び入りでライブをやるって噂でしたけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「メリメロの『メ』の字もありませんの。やはり、噂は噂でしたのね。ガッカリですの！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「まぁ、メリメロといえば地元では最高峰のトップアイドルですしね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「こんな商店街のちいさなお祭りに、顔をだすわけもありませんの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「ちょっと考えたらガセネタだってわかるのに、それでも足を運んでしまったのはメリメロへの愛ゆえに……！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「かいり以外にも、噂に踊らされたファンをちらほら見かけますの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「ほんとにメリメロがきてるなら、どっかで騒ぎになってるはずですけど～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「みんな『しょんぼり』してる感じですし、やっぱりメリメロはきてないのかしら？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「ほんとにもう、とんだ無駄足でしたの！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「でもでも、近ごろこのへんでメリメロの目撃情報がおおいし！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「ちょっと足を運べば、メリメロの本拠地である事務所とかテレビ局とかあるし！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「万が一にはありえるかも、ワンチャンありますの～！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「と思って期待したんですけど、そう都合よくはいかないみたいですの！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「あぁもう、死ぬほど歩いてメリメロを探したから足が痛いですの！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「まさに、骨折り損のくたびれ儲けですの～！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「うう、筋肉痛……。かいりも、たまには運動しないといけませんの。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -10,
      "y": 426
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「学校への登下校も車で送り迎えしてもらわずに、徒歩にしたほうがいいかしら？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "かいり",
    "text": "「おとなりの家のマルちゃんも、徒歩で通学してるみたいですし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 50,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
